 or Illustrates Concepts from the Surrounding Content**:\n  - The table directly supports the evaluation of RAG systems by providing a comprehensive dataset with varying document types and complexities. This helps in understanding how well RAG systems can handle different types of documents and the associated challenges.\n  \nThe table is a critical component in the evaluation of multimodal RAG systems, providing a structured and detailed view of the document types and their characteristics, which is essential for understanding the performance of these systems in real-world scenarios."}
